  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 00_Prologue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_00
  storyName: Three Rules
  storyDescription: A faint voice explains the rules of the Concept World.
  chapterLabel: PROLOGUE
  previousStory: {fileID: 0}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 0}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A faint voice begins speaking.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: There is no music. No visible environment. Only a voice explaining something
        that sounds almost like an instruction manual.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Before you enter the Concept World, there are three rules you must understand.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: These rules are not suggestions. They are the foundation of how you must
        understand everything you encounter there.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 2
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: RULE 01
      heading: CONCEPT SPIRITS ARE NOT HUMAN.
      text: Think of them as animals. They may look, speak, or behave like humans,
        but don't mistake their appearance for what they are.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Their personalities, bodies, and behaviors are merely how your mind interprets
        something that would otherwise be incomprehensible.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 2
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: RULE 02
      heading: CONCEPT SPIRITS WILL ALWAYS SEEK WAYS TO MAINTAIN OR INCREASE THEIR
        RELEVANCE.
      text: Their actions are driven by the concepts they represent and humanity's
        collective understanding of them.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Some may cooperate. Others may compete. Their interests can overlap,
        contradict, or even depend on one another.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Do not assume that their actions are motivated by the same reasons as
        yours.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 2
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: RULE 03
      heading: THERE IS NO SUCH THING AS GOOD OR EVIL AMONG CONCEPT SPIRITS.
      text: Don't judge them by human morality. Helping some concepts while harming
        others doesn't make them good or evil.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A Concept Spirit may cause something terrible without understanding it
        as an act of cruelty. Another may help you for reasons you would never expect.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...That's quite a lot to remember.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You will understand eventually.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Eventually? That's reassuring.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Remember these rules, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Wait. Your Majesty?
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You are about to enter a world that does not operate according to human
        principles.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: The sound of a digital interface hums to life.
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: "Hold on. I haven't even agreed to\u2014"
      blackScreen: 1
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 1
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  background: {fileID: 0}
  storyRewards: []
  rewardEntries: []
